00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,741
At ten times leverage, a ten percent drop wipes you out.

2
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:12,606
Leverage multiplies everything. Without it, a ten percent drop costs ten percent. At two times, it costs twenty.

3
00:00:12,975 --> 00:00:15,745
At ten times, it can cost everything you put in.

4
00:00:16,245 --> 00:00:25,216
Learn it with practice money first. On Meme Street, Pro players can use up to ten times leverage, so you can see exactly what it does before it matters.

5
00:00:25,716 --> 00:00:28,506
Learn leverage safely at memestreet.net.

